# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Ausgabe schreiben: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), stopp.
Ausgabe schreiben: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), stopp.
Ausgabe schreiben: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), stopp.
Ausgabe schreiben: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), stopp.
Ausgabe schreiben: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), stopp.
Ausgabe schreiben: ([''] tccompare: ['']), stopp.
